// Title: Log Analytics workspaces visible to the sign-in (name, RG, subscription, workspace id)
// Purpose: Find the workspace GUID (customerId) that az monitor log-analytics query -w and the query API need.
// Source table(s): Azure Resource Graph, resources (microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces)
// Parameters to edit: none.
// Notes/traps: properties.customerId IS the workspace GUID for queries. It is not the same as the ARM
//          resource id or the subscription id.
resources
| where type =~ 'microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces'
| project name, resourceGroup, subscriptionId, workspaceId = tostring(properties.customerId),
    retentionDays = tostring(properties.retentionInDays), sku = tostring(properties.sku.name)
| order by name asc
